              {
                "name": "workspace_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Delete a workspace user access by id.\n\nThis route will also conditionally delete the user's account membership if:\n- account membership of the actor has `Collaborator` role\n- the actor has no more workspace accesses under the account\n\nRequired workspace scopes: `manage_workspace_users`"
